eason POL-NS-03 (wrong entrance) does not apply: the driver's stationary fixes are inside the radius, not outside it within 400 m. (2) POL-NS-04 does not exonerate the rider, because limb (a) fails: the only message the rider sent in the waiting window was 'ok' at 07:41:07, an acknowledgement of the driver's 'here', not a message whose content is locating or coordinating (own position, an entrance/block/tower/bay, a request for the driver's position, or a statement they cannot see the vehicle). Limb (a) must hold alongside limbs (b) and (c). Limb (c) is in fact satisfied (66 rider fixes, all within 10.55 m of the pin, inside the 100 m STANDARD presence radius) and limb (b) is satisfied (no driver reply within 120 s), but with limb (a) failed the clause does not apply; POL-NS-11 is not engaged because the rider track is present and runnable. (3) POL-NS-05 does not help: the arrival marker is truthful — at 07:39:37 the driver was 41.4 m from the pin, far inside the 300 m test, and stationary at 0.0 kph, far below 15 kph — so the waiting clock is not recomputed and no false-arrival referral arises. (4) POL-NS-06 yields no shortfall: the effective dwell of 360 s exceeds the 180 s minimum, so no refund follows on that route.\n\nCompensation. POL-NS-07 pays the driver 80% of the fee in force: 0.8 x SGD 4.50 = SGD 3.60, the same figure the fare breakdown's money block computes. The anti-farming check does not trip and compensation is not withheld: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 1 (below the 4 required) and 1 / 133 completed trips = 0.0075 (below the 0.08 rate test), and both limbs must hold to withhold. Under POL-GEN-03 a DRIVER_COMPENSATION ruling carries the same figure in amount_sgd and driver_compensation_sgd, so both read SGD 3.60; the rider's own charge is unaffected.\n\nEvidence weight and integrity. No artifact below weight 1.0 carries any deciding fact. Arrival and dwell rest on EV-GPS-02719 and EV-TRIP-02719, both weight 1.0 and COMPLETE (100% coverage, 67 fixes, no gaps, max_gap_sec 0.0), and the fee amount reconciles on EV-FARE-02719, weight 1.0 (cancellation_fee 4.50 = platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd, so no POL-NS-08(d) defect). The POL-GEN-02(2) confidence cap is therefore 1.0 and confidence is stated at 0.90. EV-ADVIS-02719-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0 (issue MISSING_ARTIFACT); it carries no fact and nothing in this ruling rests on it. Its only effect is to make the accumulated-dwell limb POL-NS-06(i) unavailable, which does not matter here because the dwell is a single continuous run that exceeds the minimum on its own. Two claims built on that artifact were discarded by the referee for citing it without disclosing its impairment, and the outcome is unchanged without them.\n\nEscalation and referrals. No POL-NS-09 trigger is engaged: confidence is above the 0.70 floor; no two admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence (the parties' statements are resolved by the trace and by POL-NS-02's radius); the parties have no repeat no-show disputes in the last 90 days (both disputes_with_counterparty_90d are 0); the anti-farming check does not trip and rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 0; and the deciding evidence is not impaired under POL-NS-08(a) to (d). There is accordingly no clause-mandated referral: POL-NS-05(ii) does not fire because the arrival marker was true, POL-RD-09(4) does not fire because the fare reconciles and there are no ERP gantries on this trip, and POL-NS-07's escalation packet is not produced because its anti-farming branch did not trip."
